Filter-list data loaded at runtime (NOT bundled in this distribution)
================================================================================

The Ghostery adblocker engine is built at runtime from the following filter
lists, which are fetched over the network on first use and cached to a temporary
file. They are NOT vendored into this distribution's artifacts.

  EasyList, EasyPrivacy
  Fanboy's Annoyance list, Fanboy's Cookiemonster list
    License:     dual GPL-3.0-or-later AND CC-BY-SA-3.0
    Used branch: CC-BY-SA-3.0
    Attribution: The EasyList authors (https://easylist.to/)

Because these lists are retrieved at runtime rather than redistributed here, no
GPL-3.0 / CC-BY-SA-3.0 filter-list data is vendored into this distribution's
artifacts.
